{
  "uid": "llm-cost",
  "title": "LLM Cost & Consumption (Unified)",
  "tags": ["ai", "cost"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 3,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Agent service (Loki meter)",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
        "query": "label_values({service_name!=\"\"}, service_name)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      },
      {
        "name": "model",
        "label": "Model (LiteLLM meter)",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(litellm_model_info, model)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "refresh": 2,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Two meters, one bill — read this before trusting a number",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Agent meter (Loki, `$service`)** — each agent self-reports `cost_usd` on its `api_request` event. Only agents talking *straight to a vendor API* know their price: today that is **claude-code**. `pi` emits `cost_usd=0` for every call because its OpenAI-compatible provider returns no cost in `usage` — so it is **excluded from spend by design** (`| cost_usd != 0`) rather than shown as a misleading $0.00. Its tokens and requests are still counted below.\n\n**Proxy meter (Prometheus, `litellm_spend_metric_total`, `$model`)** — LiteLLM prices every call that crosses the proxy: `pi`, `bebop`, OpenClaw agents, Compass `gpt-5` / `gpt-5.6-sol`, and the local llama-swap models (which correctly price at $0). **This is where pi's real spend lives.**\n\nThe two meters are disjoint — claude-code does not cross the proxy — so *Total spend* is their sum. Prometheus retains 30d, Loki only 7d: ranges beyond 7d show proxy spend only."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Spend (range) — agent-reported",
      "description": "Loki meter. Agents with no cost source (pi) are filtered out instead of rendering a false $0.00 — if pi ever starts reporting real cost it appears here automatically.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name)(sum_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | event_name=`api_request` | cost_usd != `0` | unwrap cost_usd [$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Spend (range) — LiteLLM proxy",
      "description": "Prometheus meter. Covers pi, bebop and OpenClaw. Local llama-swap models price at $0, which is correct, not missing data.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(increase(litellm_spend_metric_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total spend (range, both meters)",
      "description": "Agent-reported + LiteLLM proxy. The two are disjoint: claude-code bypasses the proxy, everything else crosses it.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "datasource", "uid": "-- Mixed --" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "hide": true,
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "sum(sum_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | event_name=`api_request` | cost_usd != `0` | unwrap cost_usd [$__range])) or vector(0)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "hide": true,
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "instant": true,
          "expr": "sum(increase(litellm_spend_metric_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__range])) or vector(0)"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "__expr__", "uid": "__expr__" },
          "type": "math",
          "expression": "$A + $B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Requests (range) by service",
      "description": "Valid for every agent including pi — request counting needs no pricing source.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 4 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name)(count_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | event_name=`api_request` [$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spend by model — agent-reported",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "currencyUSD", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} / {{model}}",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name, model)(sum_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | event_name=`api_request` | cost_usd != `0` | unwrap cost_usd [$__interval]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Spend by model — LiteLLM proxy",
      "description": "USD accrued per $__interval bucket, so the area under the curve equals the range spend on the tile above.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "currencyUSD", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}",
          "expr": "sum by (model)(increase(litellm_spend_metric_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__interval]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens by type — agent-reported",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} input",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name)(sum_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | event_name=`api_request` | unwrap input_tokens [$__interval]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} output",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name)(sum_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | event_name=`api_request` | unwrap output_tokens [$__interval]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} cache-read",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name)(sum_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | event_name=`api_request` | unwrap cache_read_tokens [$__interval]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LiteLLM proxy tokens/s",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 16 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "legendFormat": "total",
          "expr": "sum(rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "legendFormat": "cache-read",
          "expr": "sum(rate(litellm_input_cached_tokens_metric_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__rate_interval]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Cache-read tokens by model — agent-reported",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "displayMode": "gradient", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
          "queryType": "instant",
          "legendFormat": "{{service_name}} / {{model}}",
          "expr": "sum by (service_name, model)(sum_over_time({service_name=~\"$service\"} | event_name=`api_request` | unwrap cache_read_tokens [$__range]))"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "LiteLLM proxy spend by model (range)",
      "description": "Follows the dashboard time picker. $0 rows are local llama-swap models — correct, not missing.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "currencyUSD", "decimals": 4 }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "sum by (model)(increase(litellm_spend_metric_total{model=~\"$model\"}[$__range]))"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "excludeByName": { "Time": true } } },
        { "id": "sortBy", "options": { "sort": [{ "field": "Value", "desc": true }] } }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
